# EXPECT: resolves nowhere on the VM's chain from that file's directory
# ouroboros#147: a literal load_file in a SPLICED child that no step of the
# VM's chain answers. The VM raises from the child's directory (caught here,
# so the program runs rc 0); a runtime call inside the native program would
# resolve from the MAIN program's directory instead -- a base the VM never
# uses -- so the AOT refuses by name rather than guessing.
load_file of "_lf147_child.eigs"
print of "after"
